#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:27
msgid "Driver Programming Model"
msgstr "驱动编程模型"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:29
msgid "All UniSDK drivers follow a unified programming model:"
msgstr "所有 UniSDK 驱动都遵循统一的编程模型："

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:31
msgid "Configure → Use → Deinitialize"
msgstr "配置 → 使用 → 反初始化"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:44
msgid "Transfer Modes"
msgstr "传输模式"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:46
msgid "Some communication peripherals support multiple transfer modes:"
msgstr "某些通信外设支持多种传输模式："

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:48
msgid ""
"**Blocking** — Synchronously waits for transfer completion, suitable for "
"simple scenarios"
msgstr ""
"**阻塞模式** — 同步等待传输完成，适用于简单场景"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:49
msgid ""
"**PLIC (Interrupt)** — Non-blocking transfer based on interrupts, no CPU "
"polling required"
msgstr ""
"**PLIC（中断）** — 基于中断的非阻塞传输，无需 CPU 轮询"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:50
msgid "**DMA** — Most efficient bulk data transfer, zero CPU load"
msgstr "**DMA** — 最高效的批量数据传输，CPU 零负载"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:52
msgid ""
"Configure transfer mode independently for each peripheral instance via "
"Kconfig."
msgstr "通过 Kconfig 为每个外设实例独立配置传输模式。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:54
msgid "Kconfig Configuration"
msgstr "Kconfig 配置"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:56
msgid ""
"All peripheral drivers are configured at compile time via Kconfig. See "
"[Kconfig Reference](../kconfig_reference/index.md) for all configuration "
"options."
msgstr ""
"所有外设驱动均在编译时通过 Kconfig 进行配置。所有配置选项请参见 "
"[Kconfig 参考](../kconfig_reference/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/index.md:58
msgid "Quick configuration entry:"
msgstr "快速配置入口："
